{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50223","headline":"送陈先生还嵩山 · 郑韫玉","name":"送陈先生还嵩山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉台金阙□微微，仙鹤联翩何岁归。\n欲识人间相望处，嵩高山上白云飞。\n（〖1〗《新唐书·宰相世系表》郑氏北祖房有韫玉，爲侍御史欢子，不载仕历，郑珣瑜、郑余庆爲其从昆，知应爲贞元、元和间人。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑韫玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50223.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50223","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}